OL,3,GNEWSAMeasles outbreak exposes hospital
OL,4,Avaccination gaps
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of front line NHS staff have
OL,7,Freceived the MMR jab, following an
OL,8,F"unprecedented" outbreak of measles at
OL,9,Fa Worcestershire hospital.
OL,11,FIn May, seven positive cases of the
OL,12,Fhighly contagious disease were reported
OL,13,Fat Worcestershire Royal.
OL,15,FVulnerable patients - including a
OL,16,Fpregnant woman - required preventative
OL,17,Fmedicine, while some unvaccinated staff
OL,18,Fhad to isolate for 21 days.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
