OL,3,GNEWSAMeasles outbreak exposes hospital
OL,4,Avaccination gaps
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorcestershire Acute Hospitals NHS
OL,7,FTrust said a review of 8,500 staff had
OL,8,Frevealed that more than a quarter in
OL,9,Fpatient-facing roles had not been
OL,10,Fvaccinated or lacked natural immunity.
OL,11,FMore than 400 have now received the
OL,12,Fjab.
